/** Body of a settings change: the settings being set, each left out (null) when it is not being
 *  changed — the clerk limit (two decimals, blank for no limit), the floor (two decimals, blank for
 *  the default 1.00), the terms (whole days, blank for the default 14), the late percent (two decimals, blank for the default 0.00), the policy date (yyyy-mm-dd, blank for the sheet's today), the period numbering from (yyyy-mm-dd, blank for off), terms per grade (whole days by grade, blank for the sheet's terms) and the cap (two decimals, blank for no cap) — and who makes the change, and the from-date of a dated setting by its key (yyyy-mm-dd; left out or blank for the sheet's today), and the proof threshold (two decimals, blank for none), and the permission matrix: the roles that may take each action, by action (a comma separated list of clerk and steward, blank for the standing rule). */
public record SettingsRequest(String clerkLimit, String floor, String terms, String latePct, String policyDate, String periodNumberingFrom, Map<String, String> gradeTerms, String user, String cap, Map<String, String> from, String proofThreshold, Map<String, String> perms) {
}
